{"sections":[{"slug":"凝聚态Abel群","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"凝聚态Abel群"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚态</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"凝聚态 Abel 群"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span> (AB6)</strong>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于指标集合</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及一族滤范畴</span> $I_j (j\\in J)$, <span lang=\"zh\">自然映射</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{(i_j\\in I_j)_j} \\prod_{j \\in J} M_{i_j} \\to \\prod_{j \\in J} \\operatorname{colim}_{i_j \\in I_j} M_{i_j}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">将凝聚态</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群视为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极不连通空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极不连通空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{ExDisc}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的层</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即保持有限乘积的函子</span> $\\mathsf{ExDisc}^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Ab}$. <span lang=\"zh\">注意到</span> $\\mathsf{Ab}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中任意的极限和余极限都与有限乘积相容</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们得到余极限是逐点计算的</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">一般而言层的极限是逐点计算的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而余极限是逐点余极限的层化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">所以此处的结论是特殊的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathsf{ExDisc}$ <span lang=\"zh\">这个表现的一个重要用处</span>.)</p>\n"}]}}}]}